<div class="page-head">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chevron"/></svg><span>About</span></nav>
    <h1>About WholesaleHub</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">A straightforward UK wholesale supplier for independent retailers and caterers.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="container prose-layout">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>WholesaleHub supplies convenience stores, newsagents, off-licences, butchers, takeaways and caterers with the everyday lines they sell and use most — from carrier bags, bin bags and batteries to soft drinks, confectionery and catering disposables.</p>
    <p>We work differently from a typical online shop. There's no checkout: you browse the catalogue, choose the quantity you need and <strong>make an offer</strong>. Our trade team reviews every offer personally and either accepts it or comes back with a counter-offer. Once we've agreed a price, we arrange delivery or collection from our depot.</p>
    <h2>Why retailers use us</h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Trade pack sizes and sensible minimum orders</li>
      <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Fair, negotiable prices on volume and repeat orders</li>
      <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Real people on the phone and WhatsApp, 7 days a week</li>
      <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Next-working-day dispatch on most in-stock lines</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Trade customers only</h2>
    <p>We supply registered businesses only. Some products, such as lighters, rolling papers and filter tips, are age-restricted and must be sold responsibly by the retailer in line with UK law.</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="card how-card">
    <h2>Ready to buy?</h2>
    <p class="muted">Open a free trade account to see trade prices, save products and track every offer.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-accent btn-block" href="/register">Open a Trade Account</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline btn-block" href="/products">Browse Products</a>
  </aside>
</div>
